  "bio": "Chris Carter is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in illustrative, black & gray, and anime styles, known for creating visually stunning pieces with solid black and vibrant color work. Based in Chillán, Chile, Chris maintains a professional approach to his craft, with a clear communication policy highlighting that bookings are to be made through means other than phone calls, ensuring a smooth and well-organized experience for his clients.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location:\n\nChillán - Chile\n13 años de experiencia \nTatuajes negros y a color sólidos 🔥\nAGENDA:  💜 MARZO 2026💜\nABONO: $10.000 sin devolución. \n🚫 NO LLAMADA 📲",
